# Rasputin Dreamweaver can't have more than seven dream counters (CR 122.4): turn 3 began with it untapped and holding
# seven, so its upkeep ability puts an eighth on it, and the state-based action removes all but seven (CR 704.5r).
# Then its prevention ability: Giant Growth makes it 7/4 so damage can be seen marked; one dream counter prevents the next
# 1 damage, so Shock marks 1 (CR 615.7). Another shield made on turn 3 is gone on turn 4 (CR 615.7, "this turn"), and Bot2's
# Lava Dart kills the 4/1.

